Hi,
two months ago an employee from Novation offered documentation to the their 
non-standard-compliant MIDI-over-USB protocol in this list. Clemens Ladisch  
was willing to implement it and Eric Dantan Rzewnicki to test it. I tried to 
write to them, but I didn't get an answer from Clemens and Eric wrote he got 
a patch from Clemens, but he have had no time to test it and he saied he 
cannot find it now, when I asked for it.

I'd like to ask if someone has the patch or the documentation, if it is 
somewhere in CVS or if someone has tested it or what happened with it.

Thanks,
Pavel

P.S.: There was also a problem with their audio and switching from 24 to 
16-bit audio. Is the problem solved now?

